[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7323.51, "timestamp": "02:02:03", "text": "おお。 1つ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7330.39, "timestamp": "02:02:10", "text": "私の頭。おそらくグループや修道院は少なくなるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7331.99, "timestamp": "02:02:11", "text": "それらは役に立つかもしれない。うん。うん。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7333.83, "timestamp": "02:02:13", "text": "うん。グループ解除を考えていました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7336.709, "timestamp": "02:02:16", "text": "すべて。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7338.629, "timestamp": "02:02:18", "text": "えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7341.75, "timestamp": "02:02:21", "text": "もっと良い方法があるはずだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7343.13, "timestamp": "02:02:23", "text": "のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7345.83, "timestamp": "02:02:25", "text": "[拍手]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7348.31, "timestamp": "02:02:28", "text": "そういうシーンなら、やっても構わない。ただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7350.31, "timestamp": "02:02:30", "text": "それ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7353.27, "timestamp": "02:02:33", "text": "つまり、それはより良い方法の1つですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7359.27, "timestamp": "02:02:39", "text": "良い方法があればいいのに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7363.669, "timestamp": "02:02:43", "text": "でも、グループは大丈夫だけど"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7367.669, "timestamp": "02:02:47", "text": "最適化されたグループ機能は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7371.669, "timestamp": "02:02:51", "text": "どんな方法でも構いませんので、それができれば良いです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7375.83, "timestamp": "02:02:55", "text": "とにかく、えっと、これは大丈夫、コントロール"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7377.35, "timestamp": "02:02:57", "text": "シフト"}]